   {
    "en": "‏The Love Story Of Eliza The Witch’s Daughter And The Prince"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "“An Unexpected Marriage… A Fated Destiny or a Chance for Happiness?”\n\nSince childhood, a noble girl lived under neglect in the governor’s mansion, treated as if she didn’t exist—without ever understanding why. But her life takes a sudden turn when she is summoned by the governor, who reveals a shocking truth—she is his true daughter, a noble by blood! Yet, this revelation was only the beginning. She is then informed of an irreversible decision—she must marry the third prince, a man infamous for his reckless and domineering nature.As she struggles to come to terms with her new fate, the governor’s wife unveils an even crueler secret, one that shatters everything she thought she knew. Is this marriage just a political deal, or is there something more behind it? And if love finds its way into her heart, will it be real, or just another illusion?\n\nA journey full of twists and surprises, as the heroine stands at a crossroad between truth and deception, searching for the love and happiness she never knew before!"
  },
